WANDB_MODE=offline \
RUN_ID="g2-exp3-aux0-top4oldfreeze-e8to16-ffn352-r256-wiki-to-code-layerwise-top4-old-freeze-qkvo-mha-a100-bf16-mb72-1800" \
STAGE1_WEIGHTS_DIR="$WIKI_AUX0" \
SHARED_ROUTER_HYBRID_PARTIAL_FREEZE_MASK="$MASK" \
MOE_AUX_LOSS_COEFF=0.0 \
MOE_Z_LOSS_COEFF=0.001 \
WANDB_EXP_NAME="G2 - exp3 aux0 layerwise top4 old expert freeze - wiki to code" \
bash scripts/experiment/a100/run_g2_shared_router_partial_old_top4_freeze_code_mha.sh
```

4. Optional: router-only finetune after code learning.

- Use the existing router-finetune path, but point `SOURCE_WEIGHTS` or `SOURCE_RUN_ID` to the aux0 partial-freeze code checkpoint.
- Keep aux off only if the comparison requires it; router finetune scripts already default to aux/z off.

